    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In early 2008, the Board of Trustees of Aga Khan University identified Continuing Medical and Professional Education as one of the strategic goals for the University. The Board advised to develop effective means for strengthening the existing Continuing Medical and Professional Development initiatives and to generate new ideas for further improving the quality of education and services of the University in particular, and the country in general.",
